#: planets/verdance/data/objectives.json:wren_brief.lines
msgid "Lumi, it's WREN. I run the Cradle, our big ship. I never stopped listening for you."
msgstr "Lumi, c'est WREN. Je dirige le Cradle, notre grand vaisseau. Je n'ai jamais cessé de t'écouter."

#: planets/verdance/data/objectives.json:wren_brief.lines
msgid "The Cradle can't land on a dead world. Let's make Verdance green again."
msgstr "Le Cradle ne peut pas se poser sur un monde mort. Rendons Verdance verte à nouveau."

#: planets/verdance/data/objectives.json:wren_brief.lines
msgid "Every plant fills your Bloom Core. When it's full, the Cradle comes down and we go home."
msgstr "Chaque plante remplit ton Cœur floral. Quand il sera plein, le Cradle descendra et nous rentrerons."

#: planets/verdance/data/objectives.json:brief.lines
msgid "Lumi, it's WREN, up on the Cradle. Your pod crashed, and my signal is weak."
msgstr "Lumi, c'est WREN, là-haut sur le Cradle. Ta capsule s'est écrasée et mon signal est faible."

#: planets/verdance/data/objectives.json:brief.lines
msgid "Pick up trash, find parts, and build a signal tower so we can talk. I'll be [glitch]listen—[/glitch]"
msgstr "Ramasse des déchets, trouve des pièces et construis une tour radio pour qu'on puisse parler. Je reste à l'[glitch]écou—[/glitch]"

#: planets/verdance/data/objectives.json:objectives[dump3].text
msgid "Fill the trash bin 3 times"
msgstr "Remplis la poubelle 3 fois"

#: planets/verdance/data/objectives.json:objectives[dump3].desc
msgid "Hold {scoop} to pick up trash. Empty it at the bin."
msgstr "Maintiens {scoop} pour ramasser les déchets. Vide-les dans la poubelle."

#: planets/verdance/data/objectives.json:objectives[dump3].lines
msgid "Start small, Lumi. Every load in the bin earns cubes."
msgstr "Commence petit, Lumi. Chaque chargement à la poubelle rapporte des cubes."

#: planets/verdance/data/objectives.json:objectives[compartment].text
msgid "Buy a bigger chest"
msgstr "Achète un coffre plus grand"

#: planets/verdance/data/objectives.json:objectives[compartment].desc
msgid "Workbench: Chest Size. Fewer trips to the bin."
msgstr "Établi : Taille du coffre. Moins d'allers-retours à la poubelle."

#: planets/verdance/data/objectives.json:objectives[compartment].lines
msgid "A bigger chest means fewer trips. The bench can fit one."
msgstr "Un coffre plus grand, c'est moins d'allers-retours. L'établi peut t'en installer un."

#: planets/verdance/data/objectives.json:objectives[hex].text
msgid "Clean the glowing hex"
msgstr "Nettoie l'hexagone lumineux"

#: planets/verdance/data/objectives.json:objectives[hex].desc
msgid "Pick up every piece inside the outline."
msgstr "Ramasse tout ce qui est dans le contour."

#: planets/verdance/data/objectives.json:objectives[hex].lines
msgid "First, one clean hex. Clear the outlined one. Green starts on clean ground."
msgstr "D'abord, un hexagone propre. Nettoie celui qui est entouré. Le vert commence sur un sol propre."

#: planets/verdance/data/objectives.json:objectives[scoop_size].text
msgid "Buy Scoop Size"
msgstr "Achète Taille de pelle"

#: planets/verdance/data/objectives.json:objectives[scoop_size].desc
msgid "Workbench: grab more trash at once."
msgstr "Établi : attrape plus de déchets d'un coup."

#: planets/verdance/data/objectives.json:objectives[scoop_size].lines
msgid "A wider scoop. More trash per grab, less walking."
msgstr "Une pelle plus large. Plus de déchets par prise, moins de marche."

#: planets/verdance/data/objectives.json:objectives[hex2].text
msgid "Clean 2 hexes"
msgstr "Nettoyer 2 hexagones"

#: planets/verdance/data/objectives.json:objectives[hex2].desc
msgid "Clean ground lets plants grow again."
msgstr "Sur un sol propre, les plantes repoussent."

#: planets/verdance/data/objectives.json:objectives[hex2].lines
msgid "Two clean hexes. Keep going, Lumi."
msgstr "Deux hexagones propres. Continue, Lumi."

#: planets/verdance/data/objectives.json:objectives[baler].text
msgid "Save up for the Baler"
msgstr "Économise pour la Presse à balles"

#: planets/verdance/data/objectives.json:objectives[baler].desc
msgid "The Baler presses bales. A bale always sells for more."
msgstr "La Presse à balles presse des balles. Une balle se vend toujours plus cher."

#: planets/verdance/data/objectives.json:objectives[baler].lines
msgid "Save up for the Baler. A pressed bale always sells for more than loose trash."
msgstr "Économise pour la Presse à balles. Une balle pressée se vend toujours plus cher que des déchets en vrac."

#: planets/verdance/data/objectives.json:objectives[power].text
msgid "Sell 3 bales"
msgstr "Vends 3 balles"

#: planets/verdance/data/objectives.json:objectives[power].desc
msgid "Full chest? Press {cube} for a bale. Carry it to the scale."
msgstr "Coffre plein ? Appuie sur {cube} pour faire une balle. Porte-la à la balance."

#: planets/verdance/data/objectives.json:objectives[power].lines
msgid "Carry bales to the scale by the bin. Three of them and the base wakes up."
msgstr "Porte des balles à la balance près de la poubelle. Au bout de trois, la base se réveille."

#: planets/verdance/data/objectives.json:objectives[tower].text
msgid "Build the signal tower"
msgstr "Construire la tour de signal"

#: planets/verdance/data/objectives.json:objectives[tower].desc
msgid "Workbench, Build tab. Then WREN can talk to you."
msgstr "Établi, onglet Construire. WREN pourra alors te parler."

#: planets/verdance/data/objectives.json:objectives[tower].lines
msgid "Build the tower, Lumi. Then I can stay with you."
msgstr "Construis la tour, Lumi. Alors je pourrai rester avec toi."

#: planets/verdance/data/objectives.json:objectives[glim].desc
msgid "Workbench, Build tab. The little bot stuck to your pod."
msgstr "Établi, onglet Construire. Le petit bot accroché à ta capsule."

#: planets/verdance/data/objectives.json:objectives[glim].lines
msgid "Lumi... something's still holding on to your pod. Small. Lantern-shaped. Patch him up at the bench."
msgstr "Lumi... quelque chose s'accroche encore à ta capsule. Petit. En forme de lanterne. Répare-le à l'établi."

#: planets/verdance/data/objectives.json:objectives[street].text
msgid "Clear the street"
msgstr "Dégage la rue"

#: planets/verdance/data/objectives.json:objectives[street].desc
msgid "Clean the 7 hexes round the base."
msgstr "Nettoie les 7 hexagones autour de la base."

#: planets/verdance/data/objectives.json:objectives[street].lines
msgid "Clear the whole street, Lumi. Seven hexes round the base."
msgstr "Dégage toute la rue, Lumi. Sept hexagones autour de la base."

#: planets/verdance/data/objectives.json:objectives[bench2].text
msgid "Add a Bot Bay to the bench"
msgstr "Ajoute une Baie à bots à l'établi"

#: planets/verdance/data/objectives.json:objectives[bench2].desc
msgid "Workbench, Upgrades tab: Bot Bay."
msgstr "Établi, onglet Améliorations : Baie à bots."

#: planets/verdance/data/objectives.json:objectives[bench2].lines
msgid "Add a Bot Bay to the bench. You shouldn't do this alone."
msgstr "Ajoute une Baie à bots à l'établi. Tu ne devrais pas faire ça seul."

#: planets/verdance/data/objectives.json:objectives[robot].text
msgid "Build your first robot"
msgstr "Construis ton premier robot"

#: planets/verdance/data/objectives.json:objectives[robot].desc
msgid "Bots tab: a Haul Bug carries your bales to the scale."
msgstr "Onglet Bots : un Haul Bug porte tes balles à la balance."

#: planets/verdance/data/objectives.json:objectives[robot].lines
msgid "The base has power! Build a helper: a Haul Bug will carry your bales. Try the Bots tab."
msgstr "La base a du courant ! Construis un assistant : un Haul Bug portera tes balles. Essaie l'onglet Bots."

#: planets/verdance/data/objectives.json:objectives[hex10].text data/radio.json:songs[verdance_sweep].hint
msgid "Clean 10 hexes"
msgstr "Nettoyer 10 hexagones"

#: planets/verdance/data/objectives.json:objectives[hex10].desc
msgid "Your Haul Bug sells the bales. Stay at the work."
msgstr "Ton Haul Bug vend les balles. Reste au travail."

#: planets/verdance/data/objectives.json:objectives[hex10].lines
msgid "Ten clean hexes. Your robots are learning from you, Lumi."
msgstr "Dix hexagones propres. Tes robots apprennent de toi, Lumi."

#: planets/verdance/data/objectives.json:objectives[base2].text
msgid "Rebuild the base to level 2"
msgstr "Reconstruis la base au niveau 2"

#: planets/verdance/data/objectives.json:objectives[base2].desc
msgid "Workbench, Upgrades tab. More robots can work."
msgstr "Établi, onglet Améliorations. Plus de robots peuvent travailler."

#: planets/verdance/data/objectives.json:objectives[base2].lines
msgid "The base can grow now. Rebuild it from the Upgrades tab at the workbench."
msgstr "La base peut grandir maintenant. Reconstruis-la depuis l'onglet Améliorations de l'établi."

#: planets/verdance/data/objectives.json:objectives[seed].text
msgid "Plant the first seed"
msgstr "Plante la première graine"

#: planets/verdance/data/objectives.json:objectives[seed].desc
msgid "Plants fill your Bloom Core."
msgstr "Les plantes remplissent ton Cœur floral."

#: planets/verdance/data/objectives.json:objectives[seed].hint
msgid "Keep cleaning. Seeds turn up in clean ground."
msgstr "Continue de nettoyer. Les graines apparaissent dans un sol propre."

#: planets/verdance/data/objectives.json:objectives[seed].lines
msgid "Something green is waking out there. Plant the first seed."
msgstr "Quelque chose de vert s'éveille là-bas. Plante la première graine."

#: planets/verdance/data/objectives.json:objectives[scoopie].text
msgid "Build a Scoopie"
msgstr "Construis un Scoopie"

#: planets/verdance/data/objectives.json:objectives[scoopie].desc
msgid "Workbench, Bots tab. It cleans a hex by itself."
msgstr "Établi, onglet Bots. Il nettoie un hexagone tout seul."

#: planets/verdance/data/objectives.json:objectives[scoopie].hint
msgid "Keep cleaning. WREN is looking for Scoopie plans."
msgstr "Continue de nettoyer. WREN cherche des plans de Scoopie."

#: planets/verdance/data/objectives.json:objectives[scoopie].lines
msgid "A Scoopie cleans a hex by itself. Build one at the bench."
msgstr "Un Scoopie nettoie un hexagone tout seul. Construis-en un à l'établi."

#: planets/verdance/data/objectives.json:objectives[zone].text
msgid "Send your Scoopie to work"
msgstr "Envoie ton Scoopie au travail"

#: planets/verdance/data/objectives.json:objectives[zone].desc
msgid "Press {open_command}, then paint hexes for it to clean."
msgstr "Appuie sur {open_command}, puis peins les hexagones à nettoyer."

#: planets/verdance/data/objectives.json:objectives[zone].lines
msgid "Give your Scoopie a hex to work on. It wants a job."
msgstr "Donne un hexagone à ton Scoopie. Il veut une mission."

#: planets/verdance/data/objectives.json:objectives[tower2].text
msgid "Boost the signal tower"
msgstr "Renforce la tour radio"

#: planets/verdance/data/objectives.json:objectives[tower2].desc
msgid "Workbench. WREN will sound clearer."
msgstr "Établi. WREN s'entendra plus clairement."

#: planets/verdance/data/objectives.json:objectives[tower2].lines
msgid "Boost the tower. I want to hear you clearly."
msgstr "Renforce la tour. Je veux t'entendre clairement."

#: planets/verdance/data/objectives.json:objectives[research1].text
msgid "Finish a research project"
msgstr "Termine un projet de recherche"

#: planets/verdance/data/objectives.json:objectives[research1].desc
msgid "Workbench, Research tab. Research unlocks new robots."
msgstr "Établi, onglet Recherche. La recherche débloque de nouveaux robots."

#: planets/verdance/data/objectives.json:objectives[research1].hint
msgid "Workbench, Upgrades tab: add the Research Desk first."
msgstr "Établi, onglet Améliorations : ajoute d'abord le Bureau de recherche."

#: planets/verdance/data/objectives.json:objectives[research1].lines
msgid "Your bench can study now. Research unlocks new machines and seeds."
msgstr "Ton établi peut étudier maintenant. La recherche débloque de nouvelles machines et graines."

#: planets/verdance/data/objectives.json:objectives[hex20].text
msgid "Clean 20 hexes"
msgstr "Nettoie 20 hexagones"

#: planets/verdance/data/objectives.json:objectives[hex20].desc
msgid "More clean ground means more room to grow."
msgstr "Plus de sol propre, c'est plus de place pour pousser."

#: planets/verdance/data/objectives.json:objectives[hex20].lines
msgid "Twenty hexes. The air already smells different."
msgstr "Vingt hexagones. L'air sent déjà différent."

#: planets/verdance/data/objectives.json:objectives[base3].text
msgid "Rebuild the base to level 3"
msgstr "Reconstruis la base au niveau 3"

#: planets/verdance/data/objectives.json:objectives[base3].desc
msgid "Workbench, Upgrades tab. It opens the Request Board."
msgstr "Établi, onglet Améliorations. Ça ouvre le Tableau des demandes."

#: planets/verdance/data/objectives.json:objectives[base3].lines
msgid "One more base level. The Cradle is watching, Lumi."
msgstr "Encore un niveau de base. Le Cradle te regarde, Lumi."

#: planets/verdance/data/outposts.json:levels[0].name
msgid "Weigh Station"
msgstr "Station de pesée"

#: planets/verdance/data/outposts.json:levels[0].desc
msgid "A working scale and skip on the frontier. Haul Bugs deliver to the nearest scale."
msgstr "Une balance et une benne qui marchent, sur la frontière. Les Haul Bugs livrent à la balance la plus proche."

#: planets/verdance/data/outposts.json:levels[1].name
msgid "Big Skip"
msgstr "Grande benne"

#: planets/verdance/data/outposts.json:levels[1].desc
msgid "A bigger skip and a wider, faster scale plate. Bales here sell for 15% more."
msgstr "Une benne plus grande et un plateau de balance plus large et plus rapide. Les balles se vendent 15% plus cher ici."

#: planets/verdance/data/outposts.json:levels[2].name
msgid "Recharge Pad"
msgstr "Plot de recharge"

#: planets/verdance/data/outposts.json:levels[2].desc
msgid "A charging pad. Robots passing over it run 40% faster for 25 s."
msgstr "Un plot de recharge. Les robots qui passent dessus vont 40% plus vite pendant 25 s."

