#: planets/verdance/data/sources.json:build.text
msgid "Wait for the part"
msgstr "Attends la pièce"

#: planets/verdance/data/sources.json:build.desc
msgid "It is on the Assembler's line. Robot building waits until it is done."
msgstr "Elle est sur la chaîne de l'Assembler. La fabrication de robots attend qu'elle soit finie."

#: planets/verdance/data/sources.json:build.hint
msgid "The workbench is building it. The Assembler would be three times as fast."
msgstr "L'établi la fabrique. L'Assembler serait trois fois plus rapide."

#: planets/verdance/data/sources.json:build.text_1
msgid "Fetch the finished part"
msgstr "Va chercher la pièce finie"

#: planets/verdance/data/sources.json:build.prompt
msgid "Pick up the finished part"
msgstr "Prends la pièce finie"

#: planets/verdance/data/sources.json:sources[burst_main].name
msgid "The burst main"
msgstr "La conduite éclatée"

#: planets/verdance/data/sources.json:sources[burst_main].toast
msgid "The burst main is capped. Old Town can thrive now."
msgstr "La conduite éclatée est bouchée. La Vieille Ville peut prospérer maintenant."

#: planets/verdance/data/sources.json:sources[burst_main].steps[feed_valve].text
msgid "Close the feed valve"
msgstr "Ferme la vanne d'alimentation"

#: planets/verdance/data/sources.json:sources[burst_main].steps[feed_valve].desc
msgid "The pump house still pushes water into the broken main."
msgstr "La station de pompage pousse encore de l'eau dans la conduite cassée."

#: planets/verdance/data/sources.json:sources[burst_main].steps[feed_valve].prompt planets/verdance/data/sources.json:sources[long_tide].steps[transfer_valve].prompt
msgid "Close the valve"
msgstr "Fermer la vanne"

#: planets/verdance/data/sources.json:sources[burst_main].steps[drain].text
msgid "Dig out the blocked drain"
msgstr "Dégage l'égout bouché"

#: planets/verdance/data/sources.json:sources[burst_main].steps[drain].desc
msgid "Litter chokes the drain, so the flood cannot run off."
msgstr "Les déchets bouchent l'égout, alors l'inondation ne peut pas s'écouler."

#: planets/verdance/data/sources.json:sources[burst_main].steps[drain].prompt
msgid "Clear the drain"
msgstr "Dégager l'égout"

#: planets/verdance/data/sources.json:sources[burst_main].steps[cap].text
msgid "Fetch the pipe cap"
msgstr "Va chercher le bouchon de conduite"

#: planets/verdance/data/sources.json:sources[burst_main].steps[cap].text_1
msgid "Bolt the cap on the burst main"
msgstr "Boulonne le bouchon sur la conduite éclatée"

#: planets/verdance/data/sources.json:sources[burst_main].steps[cap].desc
msgid "A spare cap lies by the pump house. Only your hands can fit it."
msgstr "Un bouchon de rechange traîne près de la station de pompage. Seules tes mains peuvent le poser."

#: planets/verdance/data/sources.json:sources[burst_main].steps[cap].prompt
msgid "Pick up the pipe cap"
msgstr "Ramasser le bouchon"

#: planets/verdance/data/sources.json:sources[burst_main].steps[cap].final_prompt
msgid "Bolt the cap down"
msgstr "Boulonner le bouchon"

#: planets/verdance/data/sources.json:sources[crusher_stack].name
msgid "The crusher yard"
msgstr "La cour du broyeur"

#: planets/verdance/data/sources.json:sources[crusher_stack].toast
msgid "The crusher yard is quiet. Ironside can thrive now."
msgstr "La cour du broyeur est calme. Ironside peut prospérer maintenant."

#: planets/verdance/data/sources.json:sources[crusher_stack].steps[breaker].text
msgid "Pull the boiler breaker"
msgstr "Coupe le disjoncteur de la chaudière"

#: planets/verdance/data/sources.json:sources[crusher_stack].steps[breaker].desc
msgid "The boiler house feeds the press and its smoke."
msgstr "La chaufferie alimente la presse et sa fumée."

#: planets/verdance/data/sources.json:sources[crusher_stack].steps[breaker].prompt
msgid "Pull the breaker"
msgstr "Couper le disjoncteur"

#: planets/verdance/data/sources.json:sources[crusher_stack].steps[jam].text
msgid "Cut the wreck out of the press"
msgstr "Découpe l'épave coincée dans la presse"

#: planets/verdance/data/sources.json:sources[crusher_stack].steps[jam].desc
msgid "A wreck is jammed in the press mouth. Cut it free by hand."
msgstr "Une épave est coincée dans la gueule de la presse. Dégage-la à la main."

#: planets/verdance/data/sources.json:sources[crusher_stack].steps[jam].prompt
msgid "Cut the wreck free"
msgstr "Dégager l'épave"

#: planets/verdance/data/sources.json:sources[crusher_stack].steps[brake].text
msgid "Fetch the brake shoe"
msgstr "Va chercher le sabot de frein"

#: planets/verdance/data/sources.json:sources[crusher_stack].steps[brake].text_1
msgid "Fit the brake shoe on the scrap crane"
msgstr "Installe le sabot de frein sur la grue à ferraille"

#: planets/verdance/data/sources.json:sources[crusher_stack].steps[brake].desc
msgid "The scrap crane swings loose until its brake holds again."
msgstr "La grue à ferraille se balance librement tant que son frein ne tient pas."

#: planets/verdance/data/sources.json:sources[crusher_stack].steps[brake].prompt
msgid "Pick up the brake shoe"
msgstr "Ramasser le sabot de frein"

#: planets/verdance/data/sources.json:sources[crusher_stack].steps[brake].final_prompt
msgid "Fit the brake shoe"
msgstr "Installer le sabot de frein"

#: planets/verdance/data/sources.json:sources[crusher_stack].steps[gantry].text planets/verdance/data/sources.json:sources[crusher_stack].steps[gantry].prompt
msgid "Park the gantry"
msgstr "Gare le portique"

#: planets/verdance/data/sources.json:sources[crusher_stack].steps[gantry].desc
msgid "Lock the gantry with its hook up. The yard goes quiet."
msgstr "Verrouille le portique, crochet relevé. La cour devient silencieuse."

#: planets/verdance/data/sources.json:sources[long_tide].name
msgid "The tanker's leak"
msgstr "La fuite du pétrolier"

#: planets/verdance/data/sources.json:sources[long_tide].toast
msgid "The Long Tide leaks no more. Kettle Bay can thrive now."
msgstr "Le Long Tide ne fuit plus. Kettle Bay peut prospérer maintenant."

#: planets/verdance/data/sources.json:sources[long_tide].steps[transfer_valve].text
msgid "Close the transfer valve"
msgstr "Ferme la vanne de transfert"

#: planets/verdance/data/sources.json:sources[long_tide].steps[transfer_valve].desc
msgid "Oil still runs down the tanker's shore line."
msgstr "Le pétrole coule encore le long de la conduite de rive du pétrolier."

#: planets/verdance/data/sources.json:sources[long_tide].steps[plate].text
msgid "Fetch the hull plate"
msgstr "Va chercher la plaque de coque"

#: planets/verdance/data/sources.json:sources[long_tide].steps[plate].text_1
msgid "Weld the plate over the gash"
msgstr "Soude la plaque sur la brèche"

#: planets/verdance/data/sources.json:sources[long_tide].steps[plate].desc
msgid "The bow is torn open. A plate from the dock will close it."
msgstr "La proue est éventrée. Une plaque du quai la refermera."

#: planets/verdance/data/sources.json:sources[long_tide].steps[plate].prompt
msgid "Pick up the hull plate"
msgstr "Ramasser la plaque de coque"

#: planets/verdance/data/sources.json:sources[long_tide].steps[plate].final_prompt
msgid "Weld the plate on"
msgstr "Souder la plaque"

#: planets/verdance/data/sources.json:sources[long_tide].steps[skim].text
msgid "Skim the slick off the shore"
msgstr "Écume la nappe sur la rive"

#: planets/verdance/data/sources.json:sources[long_tide].steps[skim].desc
msgid "The last of the oil lies on the lot. Skim it by hand."
msgstr "Le reste du pétrole s'étale sur le terrain. Écume-le à la main."

#: planets/verdance/data/sources.json:sources[long_tide].steps[skim].prompt
msgid "Skim the slick"
msgstr "Écumer la nappe"

#: planets/verdance/data/sources.json:sources[long_tide].steps[boom].text
msgid "Winch the boom shut"
msgstr "Ferme le barrage au treuil"

#: planets/verdance/data/sources.json:sources[long_tide].steps[boom].desc
msgid "Close the boom round the hull so nothing drifts out."
msgstr "Referme le barrage autour de la coque pour que rien ne dérive."

#: planets/verdance/data/sources.json:sources[long_tide].steps[boom].prompt
msgid "Winch the boom"
msgstr "Fermer le barrage"

#: planets/verdance/data/sources.json:sources[incinerator].name
msgid "The incinerator"
msgstr "L'incinérateur"

#: planets/verdance/data/sources.json:sources[incinerator].toast
msgid "The incinerator is cold. Highreach can thrive now."
msgstr "L'incinérateur est froid. Highreach peut prospérer maintenant."

#: planets/verdance/data/sources.json:sources[incinerator].steps[feed_belt].text
msgid "Stop the feed belt"
msgstr "Arrête le tapis d'alimentation"

#: planets/verdance/data/sources.json:sources[incinerator].steps[feed_belt].desc
msgid "The belt still carries waste into the furnace."
msgstr "Le tapis porte encore des déchets dans le four."

#: planets/verdance/data/sources.json:sources[incinerator].steps[feed_belt].prompt
msgid "Stop the belt"
msgstr "Arrêter le tapis"

#: planets/verdance/data/sources.json:sources[incinerator].steps[filter].text
msgid "Scrub the choked flue"
msgstr "Récure le conduit bouché"

#: planets/verdance/data/sources.json:sources[incinerator].steps[filter].desc
msgid "Soot packs the flue. Scrub it out before the fire dies."
msgstr "La suie bouche le conduit. Récure-le avant que le feu ne s'éteigne."

#: planets/verdance/data/sources.json:sources[incinerator].steps[filter].prompt
msgid "Scrub the flue"
msgstr "Récurer le conduit"

#: planets/verdance/data/sources.json:sources[incinerator].steps[cartridge].text
msgid "Fetch a filter cartridge"
msgstr "Va chercher une cartouche filtrante"

#: planets/verdance/data/sources.json:sources[incinerator].steps[cartridge].text_1
msgid "Fit the cartridge in the flue duct"
msgstr "Installe la cartouche dans la gaine du conduit"

#: planets/verdance/data/sources.json:sources[incinerator].steps[cartridge].desc
msgid "A clean cartridge catches what the stacks still breathe out."
msgstr "Une cartouche propre retient ce que les cheminées soufflent encore."

#: planets/verdance/data/sources.json:sources[incinerator].steps[cartridge].prompt
msgid "Pick up the cartridge"
msgstr "Ramasser la cartouche"

#: planets/verdance/data/sources.json:sources[incinerator].steps[cartridge].final_prompt
msgid "Fit the cartridge"
msgstr "Installer la cartouche"

#: planets/verdance/data/sources.json:sources[incinerator].steps[dampers].text
msgid "Shut the furnace dampers"
msgstr "Ferme les registres du four"

#: planets/verdance/data/sources.json:sources[incinerator].steps[dampers].desc
msgid "With the dampers shut the fire goes out for good."
msgstr "Registres fermés, le feu s'éteint pour de bon."

#: planets/verdance/data/sources.json:sources[incinerator].steps[dampers].prompt
msgid "Shut the dampers"
msgstr "Fermer les registres"

#: planets/verdance/data/sources.json:sources[treatment_works].name
msgid "The treatment works"
msgstr "La station d'épuration"

#: planets/verdance/data/sources.json:sources[treatment_works].toast
msgid "The treatment works runs clear. Lowmeadow can thrive now."
msgstr "La station d'épuration tourne au clair. Lowmeadow peut prospérer maintenant."

#: planets/verdance/data/sources.json:sources[treatment_works].steps[sluice].text
msgid "Close the inlet sluice"
msgstr "Ferme la vanne d'entrée"

#: planets/verdance/data/sources.json:sources[treatment_works].steps[sluice].desc
msgid "Fouled water still pours into the tanks."
msgstr "De l'eau souillée se déverse encore dans les bassins."

#: planets/verdance/data/sources.json:sources[treatment_works].steps[sluice].prompt
msgid "Close the sluice"
msgstr "Fermer la vanne"

#: planets/verdance/data/sources.json:sources[treatment_works].steps[channel].text
msgid "Dig the sludge out of the channel"
msgstr "Retire la boue du canal"

#: planets/verdance/data/sources.json:sources[treatment_works].steps[channel].desc
msgid "Poisoned sludge blocks the channel. Dig it out by hand."
msgstr "Une boue empoisonnée bloque le canal. Retire-la à la main."

#: planets/verdance/data/sources.json:sources[treatment_works].steps[channel].prompt
msgid "Dig out the sludge"
msgstr "Retirer la boue"

#: planets/verdance/data/sources.json:sources[treatment_works].steps[lime].text
msgid "Fetch the lime sacks"
msgstr "Va chercher les sacs de chaux"

#: planets/verdance/data/sources.json:sources[treatment_works].steps[lime].text_1
msgid "Dose the settling tank"
msgstr "Dose le bassin de décantation"

#: planets/verdance/data/sources.json:sources[treatment_works].steps[lime].desc
msgid "Lime settles the poison so the water can clear."
msgstr "La chaux fait décanter le poison pour que l'eau s'éclaircisse."

#: planets/verdance/data/sources.json:sources[treatment_works].steps[lime].prompt
msgid "Pick up the lime sacks"
msgstr "Ramasser les sacs de chaux"

#: planets/verdance/data/sources.json:sources[treatment_works].steps[lime].final_prompt
msgid "Dose the tank"
msgstr "Doser le bassin"

#: planets/verdance/data/sources.json:sources[treatment_works].steps[outfall].text
msgid "Fetch the outfall plug"
msgstr "Va chercher le bouchon de l'émissaire"

#: planets/verdance/data/sources.json:sources[treatment_works].steps[outfall].text_1
msgid "Seal the cracked outfall"
msgstr "Colmate l'émissaire fissuré"

#: planets/verdance/data/sources.json:sources[treatment_works].steps[outfall].desc
msgid "The outfall leaks onto the meadow until it is sealed."
msgstr "L'émissaire fuit sur la prairie tant qu'il n'est pas colmaté."

#: planets/verdance/data/sources.json:sources[treatment_works].steps[outfall].prompt
msgid "Pick up the plug"
msgstr "Ramasser le bouchon"

#: planets/verdance/data/sources.json:sources[treatment_works].steps[outfall].final_prompt
msgid "Seal the outfall"
msgstr "Colmater l'émissaire"

#: planets/verdance/data/sources.json:sources[treatment_works].steps[pumps].text
msgid "Start the clean water pumps"
msgstr "Démarre les pompes d'eau propre"

#: planets/verdance/data/sources.json:sources[treatment_works].steps[pumps].desc
msgid "Everything is tight. Send clean water through the works."
msgstr "Tout est étanche. Envoie de l'eau propre dans la station."

#: planets/verdance/data/sources.json:sources[treatment_works].steps[pumps].prompt
msgid "Start the pumps"
msgstr "Démarrer les pompes"

#: planets/verdance/data/sources.json:sources[launch_pad].name
msgid "The rocket"
msgstr "La fusée"

#: planets/verdance/data/sources.json:sources[launch_pad].toast
msgid "The rocket stands ready on Launch Pad 1."
msgstr "La fusée est prête sur le Pas de tir 1."

#: planets/verdance/data/sources.json:sources[launch_pad].steps[launch_frame].text planets/verdance/data/sources.json:sources[launch_pad].steps[launch_frame].prompt
msgid "Build the launch frame"
msgstr "Construis le châssis de lancement"

#: planets/verdance/data/sources.json:sources[launch_pad].steps[launch_frame].text_1
msgid "Fit the launch frame on the pad"
msgstr "Installe le châssis de lancement sur le pas de tir"

#: planets/verdance/data/sources.json:sources[launch_pad].steps[launch_frame].desc
msgid "The rocket to the next world starts with its frame."
msgstr "La fusée vers le prochain monde commence par son châssis."

#: planets/verdance/data/sources.json:sources[launch_pad].steps[launch_frame].final_prompt
msgid "Fit the launch frame"
msgstr "Installer le châssis"

#: planets/verdance/data/sources.json:sources[launch_pad].steps[fuel_tanks].text planets/verdance/data/sources.json:sources[launch_pad].steps[fuel_tanks].prompt
msgid "Build the fuel tanks"
msgstr "Construis les réservoirs de carburant"

#: planets/verdance/data/sources.json:sources[launch_pad].steps[fuel_tanks].text_1 planets/verdance/data/sources.json:sources[launch_pad].steps[fuel_tanks].final_prompt
msgid "Fit the fuel tanks"
msgstr "Installer les réservoirs de carburant"

#: planets/verdance/data/sources.json:sources[launch_pad].steps[fuel_tanks].desc
msgid "Tanks next: the rocket has a long way to go."
msgstr "Les réservoirs ensuite : la fusée a un long chemin à faire."

#: planets/verdance/data/sources.json:sources[launch_pad].steps[engine_cluster].text planets/verdance/data/sources.json:sources[launch_pad].steps[engine_cluster].prompt
msgid "Build the engine cluster"
msgstr "Construis le groupe de moteurs"

#: planets/verdance/data/sources.json:sources[launch_pad].steps[engine_cluster].text_1
msgid "Fit the engine cluster"
msgstr "Installer le groupe de moteurs"

#: planets/verdance/data/sources.json:sources[launch_pad].steps[engine_cluster].desc
msgid "Five engines, made from what the city threw away."
msgstr "Cinq moteurs, faits de ce que la ville a jeté."

#: planets/verdance/data/sources.json:sources[launch_pad].steps[engine_cluster].final_prompt
msgid "Fit the engines"
msgstr "Installer les moteurs"

#: planets/verdance/data/sources.json:sources[launch_pad].steps[guidance_core].text planets/verdance/data/sources.json:sources[launch_pad].steps[guidance_core].prompt
msgid "Build the guidance core"
msgstr "Construis le cœur de guidage"

#: planets/verdance/data/sources.json:sources[launch_pad].steps[guidance_core].text_1 planets/verdance/data/sources.json:sources[launch_pad].steps[guidance_core].final_prompt
msgid "Fit the guidance core"
msgstr "Installer le cœur de guidage"

#: planets/verdance/data/sources.json:sources[launch_pad].steps[guidance_core].desc
msgid "The core knows the way to the next world."
msgstr "Le cœur connaît le chemin du prochain monde."

#: planets/verdance/data/sources.json:sources[launch_pad].steps[hull_plates].text planets/verdance/data/sources.json:sources[launch_pad].steps[hull_plates].prompt
msgid "Build the hull plates"
msgstr "Construis les plaques de coque"

#: planets/verdance/data/sources.json:sources[launch_pad].steps[hull_plates].text_1 planets/verdance/data/sources.json:sources[launch_pad].steps[hull_plates].final_prompt
msgid "Fit the hull plates"
msgstr "Installer les plaques de coque"

#: planets/verdance/data/sources.json:sources[launch_pad].steps[hull_plates].desc
msgid "Close the bare frames. The rocket takes its shape."
msgstr "Habille les cadres nus. La fusée prend forme."

#: planets/verdance/data/sources.json:sources[launch_pad].steps[nose_cone].text planets/verdance/data/sources.json:sources[launch_pad].steps[nose_cone].prompt
msgid "Build the nose cone"
msgstr "Construis la coiffe"

#: planets/verdance/data/sources.json:sources[launch_pad].steps[nose_cone].text_1 planets/verdance/data/sources.json:sources[launch_pad].steps[nose_cone].final_prompt
msgid "Fit the nose cone"
msgstr "Installer la coiffe"

#: planets/verdance/data/sources.json:sources[launch_pad].steps[nose_cone].desc
msgid "The last part. Then the rocket is ready."
msgstr "La dernière pièce. Ensuite la fusée sera prête."

#: planets/verdance/data/stations.json:conveyor.name
msgid "Conveyor Feeder"
msgstr "Convoyeur"

#: planets/verdance/data/stations.json:conveyor.desc
msgid "A hopper pad and a powered belt into the scale. Drop bales on the pad; haulers use it when it is closer."
msgstr "Un plot-trémie et un tapis motorisé vers la balance. Dépose les balles sur le plot ; les transporteurs l'utilisent quand il est plus proche."

#: planets/verdance/data/stations.json:auto_baler.name
msgid "Auto-baler"
msgstr "Presse auto"

#: planets/verdance/data/stations.json:auto_baler.desc
msgid "A hydraulic baling press dropped at the cleaning frontier. Cleaner robots tip their hoppers into it instead of baling on the spot; it presses denser bales for the haulers."
msgstr "Une presse à balles hydraulique posée sur le front de nettoyage. Les robots nettoyeurs y vident leurs trémies au lieu de presser sur place ; elle fait des balles plus denses pour les transporteurs."

#: planets/verdance/data/stations.json:recycler.desc
msgid "Shredder drums and a little smelter. Bales go in and never come back: out come parts and clean building stock. Every bale burnt clean helps the sky."
msgstr "Des tambours broyeurs et un petit four. Les balles entrent et ne reviennent jamais : il en sort des pièces et des matériaux propres. Chaque balle brûlée proprement aide le ciel."

